  "fullDescription": "A cozy watercolor woodland clipart bundle featuring cute kawaii forest animals, autumn leaves, mushrooms, acorns, cocoa mugs, knit accessories, and soft nursery-friendly details. Perfect for baby shower invitations, nursery wall art, stickers, mugs, greeting cards, sublimation designs, and autumn printables.\n\nCreate sweet and cozy autumn designs with this Cozy Woodland Friends watercolor clipart set.\n\nThis collection includes adorable kawaii forest animals and matching woodland elements in a warm, soft watercolor style. You will find cute foxes, owls, hedgehogs, fawns, bunnies, bears, squirrels, badger and raccoon-style woodland friends, plus mushrooms, acorns, autumn leaves, cozy knit accessories, cocoa details, stars, a blank wooden sign, and a decorative border.\n\nThese PNG graphics are ideal for nursery decor, baby shower invitations, first birthday designs, greeting cards, planner stickers, mugs, tote bags, sublimation projects, printable party decorations, scrapbooking, and seasonal autumn products.\n\nIncluded:\n40 individual PNG clipart files\nTransparent backgrounds\nHigh-resolution raster artwork\nCute watercolor woodland style\nSeparate elements for easy design use\n\nThis set works beautifully for:\nNursery wall art\nBaby shower invitations\nAutumn party printables\nGreeting cards\nSticker sheets\nMug and tumbler designs\nSublimation projects\nScrapbook layouts\nPrintable stationery\nKids and baby-themed products\n\nPlease note:\nThis is a digital download. No physical product will be shipped.\nColors may vary slightly depending on your screen, printer, and paper type.",
